window.products.push({"id":908017,"name":"Wooden Music Boxes, to My Son Vintage Hand Crank Music Box, Gifts for Christmas, Thanksgiving, Birthday, Graduation, Children's Day - Play You are My ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+FA1WgkCL._AC_.jpg","description":"The clearly and meaningful words and patterns are engraved inside of the music box: \"TO MY SON, I sometimes wish you were still small not yet so big and strong and tall for when I think of yesterday, I close my eyes and see you play. I often miss that little boy who pestered me to buy a toy, who filled my days with pure delight from early morning to late at night. I watch my child change and grow as seasons come, then quickly go, but God has a perfect plan to shape a boy into a man. Today, my son. I’m proud of you for all the thoughtful things you do. I’ll love you till my days are done, And I’m so grateful you’re my son.\" When your kid is reading this message, it will keep encouraging your kid to move forward.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+FA1WgkCL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Honluntech","source_asin":"B09HH276BW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HH276BW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HH276BW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
