window.products.push({"id":908020,"name":"FlexiFreeze 8 Cube ice Strip","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k0UjzJrpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"FlexiFreeze Re-Freezable Ice Sheets are the convenient and economical replacement for soggy bags of ice. FlexiFreeze can be cut to just the right size and is flexible when frozen. Store FlexiFreeze Re-Freezable Ice Sheets in your freezer so that they are ready to use whenever you need them. Forget the trip to the local convenience store for bags of ice that leave your cooler a soggy mess. FlexiFreeze Ice is made from 100% pure water and can be frozen over and over again.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k0UjzJrpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FlexiFreeze","source_asin":"B07G4J8RPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G4J8RPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G4J8RPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":908021,"name":"Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liner for Ninja Dual,100PCS Air Fryer Liners Rectangle 8.6x 5.5'', Air fryer Parchment Liners for Ninja DZ201 DZ401, Ninja ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+oQ3nntfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【KEEP YOUR AIR FRYER CLEAN】:These disposable paper liners 8in can effectively keep food residue away from fryer and make it as clean as unused.Just throw away the air fryer parchment paper liners after use. No need to clean the fryer anymore. These air paper liners are must have for baking and cooking. 【Air Fryer Baking Liners】Baking paper using food grade parchment, it is waterproof, oil-proof, non-stick, nice heat resistant, can withstand temperatures up to 428 degrees Fahrenheit. It has no effect on the taste of food. [NOTE]:Do not put empty parchment paper liners when preheating, and do not use too little food to avoid disposable paper liners that cannot be pressed because of their light weight, and hot air blowing the paper liners into the heat pipe causing the paper pan to burn. 【UNIQUE DESIGN】:These Air Fryer Parchment Paper Liners are designed with a rectangle bowl shape, which do not need to tear, fold, cut, nor bend, and you can directly put it in when you are ready to cook. Its heightened edge 4.3cm/1.7in can protect the side of fryers from food residue can it's easy to take the food out with the heightened edge. 🥐【NO INTERFERING WITH INTERNAL AIR CIRCULATION】 : The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, so although without holes,it won't affect the air circulation by using these air fryer parchment.And compared with the air fryer paper with holes, they can effectively keep food residue away from fryer bottom.When baking, the grease comes out to the paper liner, giving you healthier foods. 【Air Fryer Liner for Ninja Dual】: The size of Air fryer Baking Paper Rectangular is 8.6 * 5.5 inch,Compatible for Ninja 2-Basket DZ201 DZ401 Foodi, Instant Vortex Plus XL 8-QT Dual Basket, PowerXL Vortex, JoooDeee, ULTICOR, Chefman TurboFry Touch, Bella Pro Series, CROWNFUL, Westinghouse Dual basket Air Fryer. Moreover, the disposable rectangle liners even fit grill and air fryer combo with a rectangular basket, intended for Ninja IG601, IG651, FG511, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+oQ3nntfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MooManGoo","source_asin":"B09YNBYJ6J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNBYJ6J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNBYJ6J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
