window.products.push({"id":908062,"name":"NewlineNY Stainless Steel Indoor Compost Bin for Kitchen Countertop, 1.3 Gallon Recycling Pail Bucket with 2 Charcoal Filters","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q1ZOEki5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Newline NY Kitchen Compost Bin is sleek, light weight but sturdy. It is made of 201 grade stainless steel for strength and durability. It is unbreakable and stainless. Stylish with simple and clean look. The 5 liters / 1.3-gallon capacity is large enough to hold up kitchen food scraps for a few days. At 11.3 inches / 28.5cm height and 7 inches / 18cm diameter is a right size and perfect for your countertop or store away. The firm sealing lid comes with 2 charcoal filters to block, trap and naturally control odors. It is an odor free and insect free solution. The sturdy stainless steel handle makes it easy to transfer scraps to your outdoor compost pile. It is easy for cleaning. Simply wash the bin with warm soap water by hand and rinse it well as you like. For the charcoal filters in the lid, simply wipe it over with a damp cloth. Once in a few months, you can also remove the filters and gently clean them in warm soapy water. The normal filter life is about 6 months to one year, and you can buy such charco filters in the market or online easily for replacement. Newline NY’s Stainless-Steel Compost Bin is a good addition to fit in your kitchen for food waste and recycling. It is also a great gift for gardeners or friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q1ZOEki5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEWLINE NY","source_asin":"B08J3QY326","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908062","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J3QY326","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J3QY326","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
