window.products.push({"id":908066,"name":"Acxcoo Glass Jars Set,Upgrade Spice Jars with Wood Airtight Lids and Talented Kitchen 180 Pcs Jar Labels Preprinted, 7.5oz 12 Pcs Small Food Storage C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xDKt+8M0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌟【Value Pack】You will receive 12 small spice jars with lids with a capacity of 7.5oz/221ml measuring 2.56” x 3.4”. Each set attaches free labels, including 135 basic spice stickers, as well as 24 expiration date labels and 21 DIY blank labels. 🌟【Safe to Use】 Made of heat-resistant high borosilicate glass, our spice container is thicker than others and safe to use as it is sterilized by high temperature. The natural bamboo wooden lid adopts an airtight design with silicone gasket to ensure leak-proof and airtight seal, and there will be no sound and scratches when opening the lid.I think the wooden lid is more environmentally friendly and healthy. 🌟【Multi-Purpose, Beautiful and Practical】I really like these beautiful little jars，The transparent glass makes you easily see what's inside and check if your food has run out. They are easy to clean, of which the glass jar can be safely placed in microwaves, dishwashers and refrigerators, while the natural bamboo wooden lid is recommended to be wiped instead of being washed. 🌟【Wide Applications】Not only a spice jar, perfect for food storage, such as biscuits, cereals, tea, coffee beans, nuts, herb, sugar, flour etc.These food storage containers are perfect for you to sort and store all kinds of fresh or dried spices, other ingredients, snacks (nut/candy/trail mix), bathroom and toiletries (cotton balls/cosmetic pads/hair band), tea leaves and other items. 🌟【100% Satisfaction Guarantee】We also provide you with a risk-free satisfaction guarantee, so that you can buy our glass spice jars with confidence. Please contact us and we will try our best to serve you if there is any damage during transportation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xDKt+8M0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acxcoo","source_asin":"B0B2DV1HKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DV1HKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DV1HKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
