window.products.push({"id":908086,"name":"UNCAPPER Jar Opener: Screw and Lift-off Lid Remover, Bottle Opener and Re-sealer. Mounts Under Cupboard-Works with One Hand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ajNpmy2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% made in the USA, the Uncapper is precision-machined quality metal construction. In a world of plastic, this cast zinc body with heat-treated high-carbon steel gripper insert is built to last many lifetimes. It is a fixture that no one will want to be without, so why skimp with light-weight models that don’t have as many functions and look cheap in your kitchen, when the best is so affordable. It exudes quality and usefulness and makes a perfect gift for loved ones because it solves problems that most don’t know can be resolved easily. It is an absolute must for seniors and anyone experiencing arthritis, parents, children, and serious cooks. No need to struggle trying to open lids when you can simply reach up under the cupboard to the UNCAPPER that grabs the lid for you while you effortlessly twist it off with one hand. Anyone who receives an UNCAPPER as a gift will be forever grateful for your thoughtfulness. This classic jar and bottle opener is now back on the market after an absence of nearly 40 years. This is the original UNCAPPER developed in the early 1960s by my father, William Woodbury (inventor of some the world’s first computers and peripherals for IBM among others), who created this handy, under-the-cabinet-mounted fixture because he said he needed an easy way to open the jars of olives for his martinis. It opens those olive jars, jam, peanut butter, canning jar rings, etc.—even pops sealed lids off of canning jars, and removes bottle caps quickly and easily. It’s mounted under a kitchen cabinet, so you don’t have to search through drawers for the right tool or waste valuable counter space with electric openers. It’s so versatile it will even re-place crown bottle caps to preserve carbonated beverages, with two built-in recesses designed for that purpose. If it ever fails to give full satisfaction, we will replace your UNCAPPER. Of the thousands sold since the early 60’s we’ve only had one return to our knowledge.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ajNpmy2KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNCAPPER","source_asin":"B01DSLL1FU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DSLL1FU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DSLL1FU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
