window.products.push({"id":908166,"name":"U-Taste Silicone Spatula Set, 600ºF High Heat Resistant, Seamless BPA-Free Flexible Rubber Kitchen Cooking Mixing Baking Scraper for Nonstick Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ijQ++1hEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why you choose silicone not stainless steel or wooden set? -Heat resistant silicone will not melt, change shape or fray at normal food preparation temperatures; -It will not damage non-stick surfaces of pot and pan; -Silicone handles are always cool to the touch. You can pick it up and not burn yourself even if you leave one lying on the stove top or someplace hot; -It is non-stick. If you rinse them off as soon as you are through with them you'll never have stuff caked on or stuck. Spoon Spatula The silicone spoon spatula is perfect for various cooking or baking tasks, including mixing dough, scraping out the bottom of a bowl, stirring in a sauce pan, serving food from the pan into bowls and pretty much anything and everything you can think of. Mini Spatula This kitchen utensils comes with a flexible flat \"blade\" which is much more effective than a spoon when it comes to transferring the batter into a baking pan. It is also perfect for tiny jobs and tiny hands, like scoop the peanut butter out of the jars. Large Spatula This type of large silicone spatula is great for certain types of mixing, including gently folding ingredients into batter. It is also great for smoothing batter in a cake pan before baking to ensure an even distribution. Its has flat blade which can scrape the flesh from the juicer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ijQ++1hEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"U-Taste","source_asin":"B09N14J8CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908166","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N14J8CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N14J8CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
