window.products.push({"id":908261,"name":"Sushi Making Kit-Sushi Roller with Variety of Rice Mold Shapes , Fish Cutting Knife with Rice Tools-Professional or Beginners Sushi Maker Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616brItlA6L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"Sushi is a beautiful combination of fresh seafood, fish, vegetables, and tangy sauces that burst with an abundance of umamiflavors. However, making sushi takes almost a lifetime to master in Japan. Thanks to a little science and innovation, now youcan use sushi molds and pro tools to achieve the desired shape and textures at home, just like the restaurants! IMPRESS YOUR GUESTS IN A BIG WAY You know that moment of pause in front of a beautiful plate of food when we think: \"Wow! This is too pretty to eat.\"Presenting your guests with a restaurant quality sushi presentation, you will induce them to have that moment of pause forawe, appreciation and recognition. Not many foods can generate such a reaction quite like sushi can. Our easy to use, DIYSushi Making Kit helps make those reactions a reality, every time! MAKING SUSHI IS MUCH EASIER IF YOU HAVE THE RIGHT TOOLS With our sushi making kit you can make great looking and great tasting sushi, right in the comfort of your home! Choosefrom four unique shapes to mix & match the desired shape you want to create: Triangles, squares, circles or hearts. Simplyline the BPA-free plastic mold with nori, spread on sushi rice, add your favorite fillings and you're ready to press a customroll. Includes a fish knife with a very sharp, long blade designed for slicing fish and cutting sushi rolls. The longer blade allows youto easily slice rolls in the pre-cut mold slots, without running out of blade length. Sharp enough to avoid having to do asawing motion, which can smash your fish and sushi rolls. Rice paddle and spatula are great tools to have on hand to handlethe hot sushi rice. CULINARY ART SUSHI MADE AT HOME Instead of heading out to an expensive sushi bar or waiting on a delivery, exercise your culinary creativity with homemade sushi rolls. Our kit makes it easy with all the tools needed to prepare and quickly press custom sushi rolls! INCLUDES 4 x Sushi Molds 1 x Sushi Knife 1 x Rice Fork 1 x Spatula","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616brItlA6L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeHut","source_asin":"B09FZTW1MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908261","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FZTW1MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FZTW1MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
