window.products.push({"id":908471,"name":"LemonsAreBlue Soccer Personalized Mermaid Reversible Sequin Pillow, Custom Soccer Sequin Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dEJ19ed8L._AC_.jpg","description":"This magical, reversible silver sequin mermaid style, soccer printed pillow case allows you to give the best personalized gift any boy or girl could ask for! No soccer player should be without one of these pillows in their home! This customized by you 16x16 pillow case features silver/blue/gold/red (you choose) sequins that reverse to white sequins, revealing our adorable uniquely personalized soccer print. The back side of the case is a super soft white faux suede almost feels like velvet. This pillow case features a zipper enclosure for easy changing if you ever want to switch out the pillow stuffing/insert.. Our premium sequin pillow inserts are also machine washable and reusable. The sequins we use are the best we have come across after testing many different types from different vendors. You'll feel the difference from our premium sequins. Please note some slight shifting of the sequins may occur after the design is printed and after the sequins are flipped. The soccer design and name is printed on to the white portion of the sequins via sublimation using our tried and true process, which basically embeds the design into the sequin. We have perfected the right temperature and time press our designs into the sequins. It won't come off and you can hand wash the sequins with warm water and light soap if needed without any harm to the design.You are very important to us, customers are #1 to our brand and if you aren't happy we aren't happy. Please contact us if you have any questions before you order or after you receive your soccer sequin pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dEJ19ed8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LemonsAreBlue","source_asin":"B07GTPZ6RP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GTPZ6RP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GTPZ6RP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":908472,"name":"Palo Santo Incense Sticks from Peru — Authentic Hand Made Smudging Sticks, High Aroma, Natural and Organic Incense — Ethical, Earth Friendly & Sustain","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SB3q16E9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHO ARE WE? We are a meditation and mindfulness brand founded 2019. The first choice for honest meditation products in the US. We deliver holistic benefits for mind body and soul with a view to helping to enrich the meditative experience.  Chakindra provides meditators and spiritualists with the tools to elevate their practice in an enjoyable and respectful way. It does this by providing high quality natural and ethically sourced products that are connected with the earth around us. CHAKINDRA derives from the words -  ‘Chakra’ - the various focal points in the subtle body used in a variety of ancient meditation practices, collectively denominated as Tantra, or the esoteric or inner traditions of Hinduism. The concept is found in the early traditions of Hinduism.  ‘Kindred’ - meaning 'akin to', in the sense of being related or similar to something. A 'kindred spirit' defines someone with similar values and desires to one's own. OUR VALUES We value integrity, empathy, and compassion.  We are here to enrich your meditative experience.  We are here to help you connect with others around you.  We are committed to helping you find clarity, leading you to a happier life. OUR FOUNDER Jag Subbanna is an avid meditator, deeply passionate about helping others elevate their lives. His discovery of meditation in Sydney, Australia transformed his life, inspiring him to found Chakindra so that he could share his passion to elevate your meditation and mindfulness practices. In his down time you can find Jag cooking, socializing, and spending time with his family. Currently, Jag resides in India with his wife, two kids, and golden retrievers. CHAKINDRA - make meditation your own.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91SB3q16E9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chakindra","source_asin":"B07SNVXDVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-908472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SNVXDVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SNVXDVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
